id: bruising-wound
name: Bruising Wound
talentCategory: damaging
prerequisites: Force and/or Magic Score of 4+
description: >
  The power behind your strikes leaves a lasting mark on your opponents.
text: >
  Bruising Wound: The power behind your strikes leaves a lasting mark on your opponents.
  –Prerequisites: Force and/or Magic Score of 4+
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Category of your Critical Result Extra Dice by 1 Category for your Wound Rolls.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If your Wound Roll’s Natural Result is 1 below the Critical Target, score a Critical Result on that Wound Roll.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Wound Roll's Critical Extra Dice, held to the same ceiling as every raise of them (actor-character.mjs dice.criticalWound,
# chat.mjs rollSide).
dice.critical.wound.category += 1;
# (2) Your attack's Wound Roll a Natural Result 1 below its Critical Target: a "Critical" button on its card before the Damage is
# dealt, once a Round - the Critical dice rolled on, and the Damage worked out again (chat.mjs woundCriticalButton).
allow wound.bruisingCritical;
